{"id":"1a01a66430bb7062","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-order10-completion-candidate.md","title":"ZFC Order10 Completion Candidate","display":"df-zfc-order10-completion-candidate — ZFC Order10 Completion Candidate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order10-completion-candidate","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order10-completion-candidate"],"display":"df-zfc-order10-completion-candidate — ZFC Order10 Completion Candidate","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order10-completion-candidate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order10-completion-candidate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order10-completion-candidate — ZFC Order10 Completion Candidate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a9536cc1c6c86510\" href=\"?note=a9536cc1c6c86510\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(C,\\leq_C)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(C,\\leq_C)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a9536cc1c6c86510\" href=\"?note=a9536cc1c6c86510\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(e,P,C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(e,P,C)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,P,C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,P,C)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CompletionCandidate}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CompletionCandidate}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}completion\\text{-}candidate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CompletionCandidate}_S(C,\\leq_C;P,\\leq_P;e)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(C,\\leq_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,P,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,P,C)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n\\left(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow e(x)\\leq_C e(y)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}completion\\text{-}candidate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CompletionCandidate}_S(C,\\leq_C;P,\\leq_P;e)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(C,\\leq_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,P,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,P,C)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n\\left(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow e(x)\\leq_C e(y)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A completion candidate supplies a complete lattice and an order embedding;\ndensity is the additional condition imposed by an actual order completion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9536cc1c6c86510","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(C,\\leq_C)$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-order.md]], [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9536cc1c6c86510","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(C,\\leq_C)$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-order.md]], [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(e,P,C)$ and $\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,P,C)$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], [[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(e,P,C)$ and $\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,P,C)$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], [[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(C,\\leq_C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(e,P,C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,P,C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CompletionCandidate}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}completion\\text{-}candidate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CompletionCandidate}_S(C,\\leq_C;P,\\leq_P;e)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(C,\\leq_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,P,C)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,P,C)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n\\left(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow e(x)\\leq_C e(y)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1550,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2856","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-order10-completion-candidate.md|58-df-zfc-order10-completion-candidate]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a9536cc1c6c86510","2aa29158e60b337f","8317eefb4572709e","36d7463d215be751"]}